effecting the reverse stock split. In some cases, you can identify forward-looking statements by terms such as &ldquo;may,&rdquo; &ldquo;will,&rdquo;
&ldquo;should,&rdquo; &ldquo;expects,&rdquo; &ldquo;plans,&rdquo; &ldquo;anticipates,&rdquo; &ldquo;could,&rdquo; &ldquo;intends,&rdquo; &ldquo;targets,&rdquo;
